<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Викторина: Вселенная «Обитель смерти» & МоррисГрад</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-color: #0b0914;
            --card-bg: rgba(22, 19, 34, 0.88);
            --card-border: rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.3);
            --text-main: #f1f1f8;
            --text-muted: #a0a0ba;
            --accent-crimson: #ff2a5f;
            --accent-purple: #9d4edd;
            --accent-gold: #ffc857;
            --accent-cyan: #00f5d4;
            --correct-bg: rgba(0, 245, 212, 0.15);
            --correct-border: #00f5d4;
            --incorrect-bg: rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.15);
            --incorrect-border: #ff2a5f;
            --font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(circle at 15% 20%, rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.18) 0%, transparent 40%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 85% 80%, rgba(255, 42, 95, 0.15) 0%, transparent 45%),
                radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(11, 9, 20, 0.85) 0%, #0b0914 100%);
            color: var(--text-main);
            font-family: var(--font-family);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            position: relative;
        }

        #bg-canvas {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            z-index: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 900px;
            z-index: 10;
            position: relative;
        }

        .quiz-card {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
            border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
            border-radius: 24px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7),
                        0 0 35px rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.2);
            transition: all 0.4s ease;
        }

        .screen {
            display: none;
            opacity: 0;
            transform: translateY(15px);
            transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;
        }

        .screen.active {
            display: block;
            opacity: 1;
            transform: translateY(0);
        }

        .brand-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            padding: 6px 16px;
            background: rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.15);
            border: 1px solid rgba(157, 78, 221, 0.4);
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
